# Strings of the embeddable agent widget (web/embed). The widget ships in the
# host page, so only its own labels live here; answers come from the agent.

embed-launcher-open = Open chat
embed-launcher-close = Close chat
embed-default-title = Assistant
embed-input-label = Your message
embed-input-placeholder = Type your message…
embed-send = Send
embed-working = Working on your answer…
embed-speaker-you = You
embed-speaker-agent = Assistant
embed-new-conversation = New conversation
embed-code-label = Verification code
embed-code-submit = Confirm
embed-code-cancel = Cancel
embed-code-hint = Only you see this field. The assistant never sees the code.
embed-session-restarted = The conversation timed out, so a new one was started.
embed-error-generic = Something went wrong. Please try again.
embed-error-network = The connection to the assistant failed. Check your network and try again.
embed-error-unavailable = This assistant is not available right now.
embed-error-origin = This assistant is not enabled for this website.
embed-error-busy = Please wait for the answer to your previous message.
embed-error-too-long = That message is too long. Please shorten it.
embed-voice-record = Record a voice message (hold to talk, or click to start)
embed-voice-stop-recording = Stop recording and transcribe
embed-voice-recording = Recording… Release the button, or click it again, to transcribe.
embed-voice-cancel = Cancel recording
embed-voice-transcribing = Transcribing…
embed-voice-denied = The microphone is blocked. Allow it in your browser's site settings to speak instead of typing.
embed-voice-no-mic = No microphone was found.
embed-voice-failed = Voice input did not work. Please type your message.
embed-voice-unsupported = Voice input is not supported in this browser.
embed-voice-empty = Nothing was understood. Please try again or type your message.
embed-voice-too-short = That was too short. Hold the button while you speak.
embed-voice-read-aloud = Read answers aloud
embed-voice-stop-speaking = Stop reading aloud
embed-voice-speak-failed = The answer could not be read aloud.
